# A 4/3 is gang-blocked by a 1/1 and a 1/4, and the 1/4 is burned for 3 before damage is divided, so it comes into
# the division already carrying damage (CR 120.3: damage is compared against toughness, not subtracted from it).
#
# The position a player actually has to read: how much is marked on each blocker is what decides whether the next
# point kills it, so the damage-assignment screen has to show the share being set and the damage already there at
# the same time. Handed over with the division unanswered, so the screen can be looked at and worked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Mountain
Vengevine
Lightning Bolt
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Fanatic of Rhonas
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Fanatic of Rhonas.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vengevine.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Attack(Vengevine)
Bot2.Block(Llanowar Elves > Vengevine; Fanatic of Rhonas > Vengevine)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Fanatic of Rhonas)
[Handover Bot1.AssignDamage]

[Expect]
Step = Damage
ActivePlayer = Bot1
Combat.Attackers = Vengevine > Bot2
Combat.Blocks = Fanatic of Rhonas > Vengevine; Llanowar Elves > Vengevine
# The burn is already marked, and a 1/4 with 3 on it is still alive: one more point kills it, which is the whole
# reason the number has to be on the card while the share beside it is being set.
Bot2.Battlefield.Fanatic of Rhonas.Damage = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Fanatic of Rhonas.Toughness = 4
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Damage = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Toughness = 1
# Combat damage has not been dealt: the division is the outstanding question, not one already answered.
Bot1.Battlefield.Vengevine.Damage = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Vengevine.Power = 4
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
